                <ul style="text-align:left;color:#fff">
                    <li>Developed and maintained 2 production platforms — <strong>Kosoor.com.sa</strong> (multi-tenant e-commerce) and <strong>WashThru.com</strong> (factory management).</li>
                    <li>Built scalable RESTful APIs with ASP.NET Core and .NET 9 using Clean Architecture and SOLID principles.</li>
                    <li>Implemented CQRS with MediatR across multiple modules, improving separation of concerns and maintainability.</li>
                    <li>Built Hangfire background jobs for notifications, reports, data synchronization, and recurring tasks.</li>
                    <li>Deployed and managed applications on Microsoft Azure, including cloud resources, monitoring, and deployments.</li>
                    <li>Optimized SQL Server schemas and indexes to improve query performance on high-traffic endpoints.</li>
                </ul>
