                <h5 style="text-align:left;">January 2024 : March 2024</h5>
                <p style="text-align:left;color:#fff"><em>Software Engineer (Freelance)</em></p>
                <p style="text-align:left;color:#fff"><em>Remote</em></p>
                <ul style="text-align:left;color:#fff">
                    <li>Delivered full-stack web applications for small and medium businesses, owning the full lifecycle from requirements gathering to Azure deployment.</li>
