                <h5 style="text-align:left;">2022 - 2023</h5>
                <p style="text-align:left;color:#fff"><em>Projects in Web</em></p>
                <ul style="text-align:left;">
                    <li>Applied knowledge to develop multiple projects in web, showcasing advanced front-end and back-end integration.</li>
                    <li>Focused on creating secure, efficient, and user-friendly interfaces for various applications.</li>
                    <li>Implemented solutions emphasizing responsive design and optimal user experience.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-12 mt-4 mt-md-0 icon-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <h4 style="text-align:left;">Support FCIS</h4>
                <h5 style="text-align:left;">2022</h5>
                <p style="text-align:left;color:#fff"><em>Software Testing Training</em></p>
                <ul style="text-align:left;">
                    <li>Trained on software testing fundamentals, including test case design, bug tracking, and reporting.</li>
                    <li>Worked with industry-standard tools to simulate real-world software testing scenarios.</li>
                    <li>Support FCIS is a student activity aimed at enhancing technical and soft skills for FCIS students, preparing them to mentor and support future generations effectively.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

            <div class="col-md-12 mt-4 mt-md-0 icon-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
