                <h5 style="text-align:left;">2021</h5>
                <p style="text-align:left;color:#fff"><em>Web Development Training</em></p>
                <ul style="text-align:left;">
                    <li>Received comprehensive training on the foundations of web development, including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</li>
                    <li>Developed interactive and responsive web pages as part of the training curriculum.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

